Each `<profile>.bin` holds the first five captured ClientHello records of
the first SNI-length entry of one browser version table
(`src/browsers/<vendor>/versions/<version>/<version>.cpp`), prefixed with a
little-endian u16 record count and per-record little-endian u16 lengths.
Regenerate with:

    python scripts/extract_camouflage_templates.py <camouflage-tls checkout>

The records are used as re-stampable templates only: SNI, session id and
random are replaced at runtime, everything else is emitted verbatim.

